# Keep LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# The shell scripts here run on Linux (the Deck) or through Git Bash, and both
# choke on CRLF -- a script checked out with CRLF fails with a confusing
# "\r: command not found". The generated launcher scripts are written with
# explicit LF for the same reason.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
